<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on</p>
<p>the second day of a three-day match between Free State and India</p>
<p>at Springbok Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Free State first innings 330-7 declared (B.Dippenaar 96,</p>
<p>C.Craven 76, K.Venter 54 not out; D.Johnson 5-78)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 56-1)</p>
<p> W.Raman c Radley b Player			   18</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Radley b Cilliers		    115</p>
<p> V.Raju c Radley b Cilliers			   1</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Cilliers b Player			17</p>
<p> S.Ganguly b Boje					16</p>
<p> P.Dharmani c Cronje b Bakkes			 4</p>
<p> V.Laxman not out					56</p>
<p> S.Karim not out					 53</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6 w-2 nb-8)				16</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets, declared)		296</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-52 2-60 3-116 4-149 5-170 6-198</p>
<p>Did not bat: A.Kumble, D.Johnson, D.Ganesh.</p>
<p>Bowling: Cillers 16.4-4-61-2 (nb1 w1), Bakkes 25-8-66-1 (nb2</p>
<p>w1), Player 19-6-37-2 (nb4), Boje 18-3-67-1 (nb1), Venter</p>
<p>12-4-38-0, Cronje 7-2-21-0</p>
<p>Free State second innings</p>
<p> D.Jordaan not out				     33</p>
<p> G.Liebenberg not out				  30</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6)					    6</p>
<p> Total (for no wicket)				 69</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Johnson 7-0-29-0, Ganesh 5-0-13-0,</p>
<p>Ganguly 4-0-17-0, Raju 1-1-0-0, Kumble 1-1-4-0</p>
